  summary  = {EU herbal monograph for arnica flower (EMA/HMPC/198793/2012). Cutaneous use only, adolescents, adults and elderly: semi-solid dosage form containing 20-25% tincture in base, thin layer 2-3 times daily; liquid dosage form 2.5 ml as an impregnated dressing 3-4 times daily; semi-solid form with 20% tincture 2-3 times daily; semi-solid form with 50% liquid extract 2-4 times daily. Consult a practitioner if symptoms persist after 3-4 days. Contraindicated in Asteraceae hypersensitivity. Not recommended under 12 years.}
}

@misc{ema2013camellia,
