  summary  = {EU herbal monograph for eucalyptus LEAF (EMA/HMPC/892618/2011) - distinct from Eucalypti aetheroleum, the essential oil, which has its own monograph and posology. Posology for adolescents, adults and elderly. Oral use: herbal tea 1.5-3 g of the comminuted herbal substance in 150 ml boiling water up to 4 times daily; daily dose 4.5-12 g. Inhalation: 3 g of the comminuted herbal substance in boiling water up to 3 times daily; daily dose 3-9 g. Contraindicated in children under 30 months. Not recommended under 12 years.}
}

